 "summary": "The Novus N20K48 is a modular PID temperature and process controller with optional RS-485 Modbus RTU. All registers are 16-bit holding registers covering identity, input configuration, control, tuning, timers, alarms and ramp/soak programs. This map covers the setpoint, process variable, output, run/auto modes, input setup, tuning and alarm setpoints.",
